          "paragraphs": [
            "I'm Vietnamese, and my name, Thiện, means goodness or kindness. I try to live up to it, at work and everywhere else.",
            "Family, food and celebrating together are at the heart of Vietnamese culture. They shape how I work with people too: show up for your team, share what you have, and make everyone feel welcome at the table."
